只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Multi-provider web search for DeepSeek Harness: SearXNG, Brave, Tavily, Gemini, and Wikipedia with per-conversation control.","id":"gh:1338525927","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-web-search-multi","slug":"zmh2000829/dsh-web-search-multi","topics":["brave-search","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","gemini","searxng","tavily","web-search","wikipedia"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Multi-provider web search for DeepSeek Harness: SearXNG, Brave, Tavily, Gemini, and Wikipedia with p"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"er-conversation control."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-web-search-multi"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Configure web search in DeepSeek Harness: choose SearXNG, Brave, Tavily, Gemini, or Wikipedia in Web"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" settings and enable or disable search independently below each conversation's composer. The plugin "},{"id":"p4s3","text":"uses DSH's native `web_search` tool. The default Wikipedia backend needs no API key and provides an "},{"id":"p4s4","text":"easy first encyclopedia query."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Providers"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| Provider | General web | API key | Cost profile | Main limitation |\n|---|---:|---:|---|---|\n| `sea"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"rxng` | Yes | No | Free when self-hosted | You operate the instance and its upstream engines |\n| `wi"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"kipedia` | No | No | Free public Wikimedia API | Encyclopedic knowledge only |\n| `tavily` | Yes | Ye"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"s | Free monthly credits, then paid | Account and usage quota |\n| `brave` | Yes | Yes | Monthly cred"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"its, then paid | Subscription setup and usage quota |\n| `gemini` | Yes | Yes | Google AI Pro can red"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"eem monthly Cloud credits | API billing is separate and requires Cloud Billing |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Pricing and quotas can change. Check the provider's current terms before deployment. The plugin send"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"s each query only to the selected provider; it has no implicit fallback or fan-out."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- The current plugin `0.2.3` requires `dsh` `0.1.5-rc.2`. Plugin `0.2.0` targets DSH `0.1.1-rc.2` an"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"d is not compatible with the newer settings API.\n- Node.js `^22.19` or `>=24`\n- No credential for th"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"e default Wikipedia backend; a JSON-enabled SearXNG instance or API credential for the other backend"},{"id":"p9s4","text":" default Wikipedia backend; a JSON-enabled SearXNG instance or API credential for the other backends"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Recommended npm installation for DSH `0.1.5-rc.2`:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Restart `dsh web` after installation. Start with an encyclopedia query using the default Wikipedia b"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"ackend. For general web information such as news or weather, open the “Multi-provider web search” se"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"ttings card, choose a provider, configure its credentials or SearXNG URL, and select “Test configura"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"tion.” Search starts enabled in each conversation."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"From a local clone for development:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"For DSH `0.1.1-rc.2`, install the previous release:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"For a Git source install, pnpm may initially block the package's `prepare` build. Follow the `allowB"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"uilds` instruction printed by `dsh`, then repeat the install command."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"The package is a DSH bundle. Installation adds its `cordis.patch.yml`, selects the stable provider i"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"d `configurable-search`, and starts with keyless English Wikipedia so the first test works without a"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"nother service. Select SearXNG, Brave, Tavily, or Gemini in the Web UI when broader web coverage is "},{"id":"p19s4","text":"needed. **The plugin does not install or start SearXNG.**"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The composer tool row has a two-part pill for each conversation: select **On** on the right to enabl"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"e search or **Off** on the left to disable it. It starts on, and the choice survives DSH restarts. O"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"ff removes `web_search` from that conversation's available tools and prompt guidance and blocks dire"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"ct calls; it does not disable `web_fetch` or Grok Build's own search. A search already running when "},{"id":"p20s5","text":"you switch off may finish; the new choice applies to subsequent tool calls and model requests. Provi"},{"id":"p20s6","text":"der selection in Settings is still shared across conversations."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Free local SearXNG"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The included Compose deployment binds only to localhost and enables JSON output. Start it once from "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"this repository checkout; the container uses `restart: unless-stopped`:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"If the plugin was installed from GitHub and no checkout exists locally, clone `https://github.com/zm"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"h2000829/dsh-web-search-multi.git`, enter that directory, and run the Compose command above. Stop it"},{"id":"p24s3","text":" with `docker compose -f deploy/searxng/compose.yml down`. Enabling, disabling, or removing the DSH "},{"id":"p24s4","text":"plugin does not start or stop this service."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Do not expose this configuration publicly without adding authentication, rate limiting, a unique sec"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ret, and the other protections required by the SearXNG deployment guide."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Configure"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Edit `$DSH_HOME/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml` (`~/.dsh` is the default home). A profile patch repla"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"ces the complete `config` value, so keep every required key shown in the selected example."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"All providers accept the top-level `requestTimeoutMs` setting from `1000` through `55000`; its defau"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"lt is `25000`, below the Harness tool deadline."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"The same configurations are available as ready-to-use files under `examples/`; use `dsh --profile we"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"b --patch examples/wikipedia.patch.yml` for a temporary override."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"### Web UI"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Open **Settings → Plugins → Plugin configuration → Multi-provider web search**. The card lets you se"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"lect all five providers, edit provider-specific options, and save Brave, Tavily, or Gemini keys with"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"out putting a secret in settings. A saved key goes through DSH credentials and the card receives onl"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"y its configured/writable status. **Test configuration** runs one real `DeepSeek` query against the "},{"id":"p31s5","text":"current draft without saving first; success reports latency, result count, and the first title, whil"},{"id":"p31s6","text":"e failure reports the provider error. Provider and option changes apply to the next search without r"},{"id":"p31s7","text":"rts the provider error. Provider and option changes apply to the next search without restarting DSH."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"The stock **Web search** card belongs to the bundled DeepSeek provider. Use the separately named **M"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"ulti-provider web search** card for this plugin."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Security and privacy"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"- Queries leave the machine and are subject to the selected provider's privacy policy.\n- Redirects a"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"re rejected so a configured or fixed endpoint cannot silently forward a query elsewhere.\n- Returned "},{"id":"p34s3","text":"JSON is validated before it reaches DSH.\n- External JSON responses are stopped at 2 MiB before parsi"},{"id":"p34s4","text":"ng.\n- API keys are sent only in provider-defined authorization headers and are not included in URLs "},{"id":"p34s5","text":"or results.\n- API keys remain in DSH-managed credential storage and are resolved once per search.\n- "},{"id":"p34s6","text":"The browser settings and test endpoint accepts only loopback same-origin requests, rejects cross-sit"},{"id":"p34s7","text":"e writes, caps request bodies, and never returns key values. A newly entered key is used only for th"},{"id":"p34s8","text":"at test request and is not written to credential storage.\n- The plugin implements search only; it do"},{"id":"p34s9","text":"es not enable arbitrary URL fetching."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
